    "すべてのアカウント": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All Accounts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "特定のアカウントを選ぶと、そのアカウントで作成中のメールでだけこのテンプレートを使えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choosing a specific account limits this template to messages composed from that account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "件名を入れておくと、新規作成の本文・件名が両方空のときにこのテンプレートで両方埋められます。空のままなら本文だけが挿入されます（署名のような使い方）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you set a subject, this template fills in both the subject and body when starting a brand-new, completely empty message. Otherwise only the body is inserted (useful as a signature-style snippet)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ツールバーの編集": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit Toolbar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ドラッグして、メール本文画面下部のツールバーに並ぶアイコンの順序を変更できます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag to reorder the icons in the toolbar at the bottom of the message view."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アカウントの種類": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Account Type"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gmail と iCloud はホスト設定が自動で入力されます。それ以外のプロバイダは「その他」から手動で設定してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gmail and iCloud have their host settings filled in automatically. For any other provider, set it up manually via “Other.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自分でホストしたプッシュ中継サーバ (otegami-relay) の URL を入力してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the URL of your self-hosted push relay server (otegami-relay)."
