    "連絡先の写真: 許可済み (基本) — 保存済み連絡先には未対応。「再認証」をお試しください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contact Photos: Authorized (Basic) — saved contacts aren't supported. Try “Reauthenticate.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "連絡先の写真: 未許可 — 「再認証」をお試しください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contact Photos: Not Authorized — Try “Reauthenticate.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "権限を確認できませんでした": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't Check Permission"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "スコープ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scope"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google に問い合わせて索引を再構築中…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rebuilding Index via Google…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アクセストークンを取得できませんでした (再認証が必要な可能性があります)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't Get Access Token (Reauthentication May Be Required)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "otherContacts.list (自動収集された連絡先)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "otherContacts.list (Auto-Collected Contacts)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "people/me/connections (保存済み連絡先)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "people/me/connections (Saved Contacts)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "people/me (自分のプロフィール写真)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "people/me (Your Profile Photo)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "索引": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Index"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "総アドレス数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Total Indexed Addresses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最終構築時刻": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last Built At"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "もう一度診断する": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run Diagnostics Again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この画面を開くたびに Google へ実際に問い合わせて索引を再構築します。表示内容のスクリーンショットにはメールアドレスを含む場合があります (エラー本文中のアドレスはマスク済みですが、他の情報は含まれないか確認してから共有してください)。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opening this screen always contacts Google to rebuild the index. Screenshots of this screen may contain email addresses (addresses in error bodies are masked, but please double-check before sharing anything else shown here)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "結果": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Result"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP ステータス": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP Status"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取得エントリ数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entries Fetched"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写真ありエントリ数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entries With Photo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "索引の一部が破棄されました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Part of the Index Was Discarded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "スコープ不足": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Insufficient Scope"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取得失敗": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fetch Failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "非表示にしたメールボックスは、ハンバーガーメニュー/サイドバーの一覧と統合受信トレイの集計に出なくなり、同期も止まります（電池・通信の節約のためです）。メールの移動先としては引き続き選べます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A hidden mailbox disappears from the hamburger menu/sidebar tree and the unified inbox count, and stops syncing (to save battery and data). You can still move mail into it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google プロフィール写真を表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Google Profile Photos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gravatar の画像を表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Gravatar Images"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "企業ロゴを表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Company Logos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "連絡先に写真が無い場合、Gmail アカウントが接続されていれば Google のプロフィール写真を表示することがあります。差出人のメールアドレスが Google に送信されます。設定でオフにできます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If no contact photo is found, a Google profile photo may be shown when a Gmail account is connected. The sender's email address is sent to Google. You can turn this off in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "それでも見つからない場合、Gravatar (gravatar.com) に登録された画像を表示することがあります。差出人アドレスのハッシュが gravatar.com に送信されます。設定でオフにできます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If still not found, an image registered at Gravatar (gravatar.com) may be shown. A hash of the sender's address is sent to gravatar.com. You can turn this off in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "それでも見つからない場合、差出人の会社ドメインの favicon を企業ロゴとして表示することがあります（フリーメール (Gmail 等) のアドレスは対象外です）。ドメイン名が接続先サーバーに送信されます。設定でオフにできます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If still not found, the sender's company domain's favicon may be shown as a company logo (free email domains like Gmail are excluded). The domain name is sent to that server. You can turn this off in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プロフィールアイコンは差出人のイニシャルとアカウント色から生成され、外部サービスへの問い合わせは一切行いません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avatars are generated from the sender's initials and the account's color, with no queries to any external service."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "署名テンプレートを編集": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit Signature Template"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "テンプレートを編集": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit Template"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "バージョン %@ (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@ (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プロフィールアイコンは、差出人のイニシャル+アカウント色を基本に、連絡先の写真・Google プロフィール写真・Gravatar・企業ロゴを優先順に探して表示します。どの情報源を使うか（外部への問い合わせを含む）は「メール一覧」設定の同名のトグルで個別にオフにできます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avatars try, in order, the sender's matching contact photo, Google profile photo, Gravatar, and company logo, falling back to the sender's initials and the account's color. Which sources are used (including which ones contact an external service) can be turned off individually from the matching toggles in the Message List settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要約中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarizing…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要約を表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Summary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要約を再試行": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retry Summary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "翻訳中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Translating…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "翻訳を再試行": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retry Translation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "訳文に戻す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Translation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原文に戻す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Original"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI要約": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI Summary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ダークモードで暗い背景に反転": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invert to a Dark Background in Dark Mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTMLメールを既定でテキスト表示にします。メール詳細画面の切替ボタンで、メールごとに一時的に戻すこともできます。ダークモード表示中、白背景・濃い文字色を明示したメール（ライトデザインのメール）は、既定では反転せずメール本来の配色（白背景）のまま表示します。色指定を持たないメールは、読みやすい配色に自動で解決されます。メール自身がダークモードに対応済みの場合は何もしません。「ダークモードで暗い背景に反転」をオンにすると、ライトデザインのメールを暗い背景に反転して表示します（文字中心のメールで暗い背景を好む場合向け）。「メールの背景を常に白」をオンにすると、色指定の有無にかかわらずすべてのメールを常に白背景で表示します（このとき上の反転設定は無効になります）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows HTML messages as plain text by default. You can switch back for an individual message using the toggle button in the message view. While in Dark Mode, messages that explicitly set a white background and dark text (light-designed messages) are, by default, left in their original (white-background) colors rather than inverted. Messages with no color declarations at all resolve automatically to a readable color scheme. Messages that already support Dark Mode themselves are left untouched. Turning on “Invert to a Dark Background in Dark Mode” instead inverts light-designed messages to a dark background (for those who prefer a dark background for text-heavy messages). Turning on “Always Show Message Background in White” makes every message always render on a white background regardless of its own colors (the inversion setting above is disabled while this is on)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "予定への招待": {
      "comment": "Task #66 calendar invite card header, above the event title/time/location.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invitation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "現在の回答: %@": {
      "comment": "Task #66 calendar invite card: shows the RSVP already recorded for this invite, e.g. \"現在の回答: 参加\" / \"Your response: Accepted\".",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your response: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "招待の内容を読み込んでいます…": {
      "comment": "Task #66 calendar invite card: loading state while the text/calendar part downloads and parses.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loading invitation…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "承諾": {
      "comment": "Task #66 calendar invite card: \"Accept\" RSVP button (also reused for the current-response label).",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accept"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "辞退": {
      "comment": "Task #66 calendar invite card: \"Decline\" RSVP button (also reused for the current-response label).",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未定": {
      "comment": "Task #66 calendar invite card: \"Maybe\"/tentative RSVP button (also reused for the current-response label).",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maybe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "参加": {
      "comment": "Task #66 calendar invite card: current-response label for an accepted invite.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accepted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不参加": {
      "comment": "Task #66 calendar invite card: current-response label for a declined invite.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Declined"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未回答": {
      "comment": "Task #66 calendar invite card: current-response label meaning no RSVP has been sent yet.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No response"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "委任": {
      "comment": "Task #66 calendar invite card: current-response label for an invite delegated to someone else.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delegated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "履歴": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "History"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存済み": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "検索履歴はありません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Search History"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存した検索はありません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Saved Searches"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "検索フィールド左の星をタップすると、今の検索条件 (クエリ・絞り込み・アカウント) を名前を付けずに保存できます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap the star at the left of the search field to save the current query, filter, and account scope — unnamed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存済みの検索": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved Searches"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この検索を保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save This Search"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この検索の保存を解除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove This Saved Search"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "表示するアイコン": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icons Shown"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "トグルをオフにしたアイコンは、ツールバーから消えて「その他」メニューの中から使えるようになります。ドラッグで、オンのアイコンがツールバーに並ぶ順序を変更できます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icons you toggle off disappear from the toolbar and move into the “More” menu instead. Drag to reorder the icons that stay on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「その他」は常にツールバーの末尾に固定表示され、オフにしたり並べ替えたりすることはできません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“More” always stays fixed at the end of the toolbar — it can't be turned off or reordered."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フッターツールバー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Footer Toolbar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メール本文画面下部に並ぶアイコン（返信・転送・検索・情報・要約・翻訳・その他）の表示/非表示と順序を変更できます。非表示にしたアイコンは「その他」メニューから引き続き使えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose which icons (Reply, Forward, Search, Info, Summarize, Translate, More) appear at the bottom of the message view, and in what order. Icons you hide are still available from the “More” menu."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
